  "Pick a spot you can reach easily: a porch step, a bench, a tree in the yard.|Leave your phone inside.|Sit for five to ten minutes. Notice sounds, light, birds, and weather.|Come back a few times this week, at about the same time of day.|Notice what's changed since last time.",
  "Restless? Start with two minutes. The stillness grows on you. Can't get outside? A window you return to works too.",
